    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Spellcasting or Pact Magic Feature)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Additional Spells.</strong> Your mastery keeps certain spells always at the ready. Once you have spell slots of a level shown in the Abjuration Adept Spells table, you always have the spells of that level and lower prepared.</p><p><strong>Protective Ward.</strong> When you cast an Abjuration spell with a spell slot, you or one creature you can see within 30 feet of you gains Temporary Hit Points equal to twice the level of the slot expended.</p><h4>Abjuration Adept Spells</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Spell Slot Level</th><th>Spell</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplShield0000]{Shield}</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLesserRest]{Lesser Restoration}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbProtectionFro]{Protection from Energy}</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBanishment]{Banishment}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMassCureWo]{Mass Cure Wounds}</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-SlBDsOyo27YPE1O9\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Choose the spells of the levels whose slots you have; add the others when you gain those slots. <em>Protective Ward</em> gives 2 Temporary Hit Points: change the formula to twice the slot level in the roll dialog.</p></section>",
